{"4384150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KUBIKA", "steam_appid": 4384150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kubika</strong> is a vibrant, soothing 3D puzzle game that turns the classic <i>Sokoban</i> genre on its head. <i>Literally</i> ! Take control of adorable little cubes and <strong>manipulate gravity</strong> to guide them through <strong>elegant three-dimensional puzzles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/c1288088d3c48a738795d88084f5314b.poster.avif?t=1783182706\" width=998 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/c1288088d3c48a738795d88084f5314b.webm?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/c1288088d3c48a738795d88084f5314b.mp4?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Immersive and Varied Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover several <strong>colorful</strong>, <strong>diverse worlds</strong> and their <strong>unique mechanics</strong>. Through finely <strong>crafted sound design</strong>, and an <strong>adaptive music system</strong>, Kubika will completely immerse you in a small, tranquil and serene universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5c468a24b435d0cd522e2ed1adcb3010.poster.avif?t=1783182706\" width=1000 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5c468a24b435d0cd522e2ed1adcb3010.webm?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5c468a24b435d0cd522e2ed1adcb3010.mp4?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles for Everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for a <strong>relaxing gaming session</strong> or an <strong>intense mental challenge</strong>, Kubika offers a breadth of levels to fit your mood. You will flow from intuitive puzzles to brain-racking, multi-dimensional challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/6ca0e6924d9ca004b2fac1922bec3427.poster.avif?t=1783182706\" width=1000 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/6ca0e6924d9ca004b2fac1922bec3427.webm?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/6ca0e6924d9ca004b2fac1922bec3427.mp4?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create, Share, Inspire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure doesn't end with us. Thanks to the <strong>built-in Level Editor</strong>, use the same tools as the developers to craft your own challenges. Bring your ideas to life, share them with <strong>a global community</strong>, and leave your mark on the world of Kubika !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5ccf53c52080468812efe3879fd666f2.poster.avif?t=1783182706\" width=998 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5ccf53c52080468812efe3879fd666f2.webm?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5ccf53c52080468812efe3879fd666f2.mp4?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Campaign Levels :</strong> Explore dozens of puzzles across a variety of biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay mechanic:</strong> A simple, intuitive premise, with unending twist and turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wonderful Soundscapes:</strong> Intentional sound design and an adaptive music system ensure your complete immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully fledged Level Editor:</strong> Create and share your own puzzles with ease on a Community platform.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kubika</strong> is a vibrant, soothing 3D puzzle game that turns the classic <i>Sokoban</i> genre on its head. <i>Literally</i> ! Take control of adorable little cubes and <strong>manipulate gravity</strong> to guide them through <strong>elegant three-dimensional puzzles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/c1288088d3c48a738795d88084f5314b.poster.avif?t=1783182706\" width=998 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/c1288088d3c48a738795d88084f5314b.webm?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/c1288088d3c48a738795d88084f5314b.mp4?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Immersive and Varied Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover several <strong>colorful</strong>, <strong>diverse worlds</strong> and their <strong>unique mechanics</strong>. Through finely <strong>crafted sound design</strong>, and an <strong>adaptive music system</strong>, Kubika will completely immerse you in a small, tranquil and serene universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5c468a24b435d0cd522e2ed1adcb3010.poster.avif?t=1783182706\" width=1000 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5c468a24b435d0cd522e2ed1adcb3010.webm?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5c468a24b435d0cd522e2ed1adcb3010.mp4?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles for Everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for a <strong>relaxing gaming session</strong> or an <strong>intense mental challenge</strong>, Kubika offers a breadth of levels to fit your mood. You will flow from intuitive puzzles to brain-racking, multi-dimensional challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/6ca0e6924d9ca004b2fac1922bec3427.poster.avif?t=1783182706\" width=1000 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/6ca0e6924d9ca004b2fac1922bec3427.webm?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/6ca0e6924d9ca004b2fac1922bec3427.mp4?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create, Share, Inspire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure doesn't end with us. Thanks to the <strong>built-in Level Editor</strong>, use the same tools as the developers to craft your own challenges. Bring your ideas to life, share them with <strong>a global community</strong>, and leave your mark on the world of Kubika !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5ccf53c52080468812efe3879fd666f2.poster.avif?t=1783182706\" width=998 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5ccf53c52080468812efe3879fd666f2.webm?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/extras/5ccf53c52080468812efe3879fd666f2.mp4?t=1783182706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Campaign Levels :</strong> Explore dozens of puzzles across a variety of biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay mechanic:</strong> A simple, intuitive premise, with unending twist and turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wonderful Soundscapes:</strong> Intentional sound design and an adaptive music system ensure your complete immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully fledged Level Editor:</strong> Create and share your own puzzles with ease on a Community platform.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "KUBIKA is a Sokoban-like puzzle adventure. Manipulate gravity and guide charming little cubes across three-dimensional, perspective-twisting puzzles. Master each world’s unique mechanics, build and share your own puzzles using the built-in Level Editor. Free Demo available today !", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/81286d52f66f91a8c29b22fdf5b0c943037a32c3/header.jpg?t=1783182706", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/4a12c80fffaca504af6f21df5263236be5e534bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783182706", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4384150/4a12c80fffaca504af6f21df5263236be5e534bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783182706", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 (Mojave)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (2.5 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus 640 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</s